    "title": "Rutgers upset by UMass escalates pressure on coach Greg Schiano - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chris Whitfield ,\n21 hours ago Rutgers suffered a shocking home defeat Thursday, falling 37-21 to UMass — a team listed as a 28.5-point underdog — a loss that has already intensified questions about head coach Greg Schiano‘s job security and the Scarlet Knights’ direction early in the season. The upset matters now because it undercuts Big Ten expectations and exposes vulnerabilities that will shape Rutgers’ lineup and recruiting talk in the weeks ahead. Read full article",
